  "reasoning": "The defendant used counterfeit cash to swap with the sellers' genuine cash while purchasing cigarettes, thereby taking the sellers' real money (盗窃). Additionally, he deceived the sellers by presenting fake money as payment to obtain cigarettes, which constitutes fraud (诈骗). Both conduct elements are clearly described in the facts and correspond to the statutory offenses of theft and fraud.",
  "final_answer": "盗窃;诈骗"
}
